KV9XmJlmgWXzvLf3ANcATLUYpD4rwLkwobWove97sVT2rP4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuSPa9EkPMfFocFpMHthetmm50Z_gNQZWm1Eg2A-0HIsw&oe=699EFEC8"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "708977614588076", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75488375_708977617921409_1075715276216507772_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=55RW9XEIdUsQ7kNvwFETOfQ&_nc_oc=AdnzkqC6O91bNpMrKZ3qMq-f7ptltoEUHCned43TW-m4yZBz4OAVvMLNySODDoxvyZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuYNq9xfsmojcpX8OgWHS0mIE5qu001pzQddG9Anprmgw&oe=699EF00A"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "1449100632372768", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031502_1449100635706101_8566828919912654030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hvlZifHKRmwQ7kNvwHrJhAb&_nc_oc=AdmFln2enHmlASn2soU2gQ1g8BsXInUM_VXs3T81hapcf02t7x9xQ1wr-PJxCtLQxQI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftR62htz6snjDXQCdaoUPEclvhMwvC-yziLakJVsKcmxQ&oe=699EF019"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "1042094833579475", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_1042094836912808_4953768684373887112_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lNviTeacTSgQ7kNvwFof2tZ&_nc_oc=Adn3rd3ekl5TRL7ysQZysYGOIHsRBADMi-axSoP2Q_6gRiXEFVtGLQYjE8JxN4JkRFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvCv3YiVdJBUmOZNeytjpNRPYs9xSv-8MwhDyaPc_Gqrw&oe=699F0700"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_thumb.png", "id": "889483612519314", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974858_889483615852647_6939535896939341857_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=idE_Btb_3N8Q7kNvwFdiiQv&_nc_oc=AdlNEJtCErx-ciGfGuj0MrgQXVT2hTTppDEdpjrBHE9qNDSHtp_JroKWSv0aTc3iH3E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvnOxNdnNDTpWbWOeCIMFbQoJZT6dRiiaKIPxSQUovSaw&oe=699EDC5B"}, "display_name": "Tabletop Basketball AR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\"Tabletop Basketball AR\" for Oculus Quest stands out as an avant-garde blend of traditional basketball gameplay and cutting-edge augmented reality (AR) technology. This game offers players an immersive experience that transforms any tabletop into a dynamic 3-on-3 basketball arena. It ingeniously combines the physical skill and strategy of basketball with the interactive capabilities of AR, providing a gaming experience like no other.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Dynamic AR Gameplay: Turn any tabletop into a basketball court with immersive AR technology.\n- Multiplayer Viewing Experience: Join games within the same environment.\n- Intuitive Controls: Designed for Oculus Touch controllers, suitable for all skill levels.\n- Realistic Graphics and Sound: High-quality graphics and immersive sound effects enhance the experience.\n- Regular Updates: Continuous game improvements and new content based on player feedback.\n\t\nWhat sets this game apart is its remarkable use of AR technology. The game transforms any flat surface into a virtual basketball court, allowing players to move around and view the game from multiple angles. This feature not only adds a layer of realism to the gameplay but also brings an innovative twist to the traditional sports gaming genre.", "short_description": "\"Tabletop Basketball AR\" is an Oculus Quest game that merges the excitement of basketball with augmented reality. In this 3-on-3 basketball game, players experience a full-fledged basketball match, enjoying the thrill of the court from a unique, tabletop perspective. The game offers an immersive, interactive experience, combining the strategy and skill of basketball with the innovative technology of AR, perfect for both sports enthusiasts and gamers seeking a novel gaming experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.redzonestudios.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RedZone Studios LLC", "support_website_url": null, "websi